he 1970s: reggae.\n\nThe term new wave was first a kind of description of a more musical and lyric wise complex music than punk.", "url": null, "artists": [{"artist": "The Killers", "streams": 41748, "best_position": 66}, {"artist": "Harry Styles", "streams": 36238, "best_position": 86}, {"artist": "David Bowie", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Depeche Mode", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Fontaines D.C.", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Madonna", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Paramore", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "The Cure", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "The Smiths", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "The Strokes", "streams": null, "best_position": null}]}, "nu metal": {"genre": "nu metal", "country_code": "nl", "country_name": "Netherlands", "summary": "Nu metal is a subgenre of alternative metal that blends elements of heavy metal with influences from other genres such as hip hop, funk, industrial, and grunge. It typically emphasises rhythm and syncopation, with guitar work often involving down-tuned seven-string guitars to create a heavier sound. Guitar solos and technical displays are generally less common in nu metal. Vocal styles vary and may include singing, rapping, screaming, and occasionally growling.", "url": null, "artists": [{"artist": "Bring Me the Horizon", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Deftones", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Linkin Park", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "Slipknot", "streams": null, "best_position": null}, {"artist": "System of a Down", "streams": null, "best_position": null}]}, "pop": {"genre": "pop", "country_code": "nl", "country_name": "Netherlands", "summary": "Pop music is a broad-term for many different types of music: The term is flexible, and the music labeled \"pop\" changes frequently. It usually refers to 